MoonStyle (lampclaw/moonstyle)

MoonStyle is an independently maintained MoonBit adaptation of selected StyleX
atomic CSS semantics. Portions of the hashing implementation and semantic
behavior were ported or derived from StyleX under the MIT License.

Upstream project: https://github.com/meta/stylex
Reference release: StyleX 0.19.1
Recorded source commit: 1fcb9a51cbecad2c82255e0f4b45cc072fa1a95a
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.

The MurmurHash2 compatibility implementation follows the upstream source at
packages/@stylexjs/babel-plugin/src/shared/hash.js. That source also credits
Gary Court and Austin Appleby for MurmurHash2; those credits are retained here.

MoonStyle's MoonBit authoring API, native extraction pipeline, component
contracts, and project tooling are maintained by the MoonStyle contributors.
Compatibility covers the documented semantic subset, not the complete StyleX
JavaScript API. The font-aliases-v1 composition policy is a local extension.

StyleX and its Babel compiler are used only in the isolated maintenance and
differential-test package. They are not production runtime dependencies or
included in distributed MoonBit artifacts.

